1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:28,500
When I fall in love, it will be forever.
當我墜入愛河 便是永恆

2
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:50,500
Or I'll never fall in love.
否則我絕不談戀愛

3
00:00:51,300 --> 00:01:11,500
In our restless world, like this is, love is ended before it's begun.
在這紛擾的世界裡 愛情還未開始就已經結束

4
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:29,500
And too many moon-like kisses seem to cool in the warmth of the sun.
太多月光下的吻 在陽光溫暖中冷卻

5
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:43,500
When I give my heart, it will be completely.
當我交出我的心 便是全然

6
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:56,500
Or I'll never give my heart.
否則我絕不付出真心

7
00:01:57,300 --> 00:02:17,500
And the moment I can feel the heart, you feel that way too.
當我感覺到 你也有相同感受的那一刻

8
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:39,500
Is when I fall in love with you.
就是我與你墜入愛河的時刻

9
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:54,500
Thank you for watching!
感謝您的觀看！
